  "description": "*“As long as you’re still breathing, you’ll have to spread your legs for me alone.”*\n\nIsaac, a soldier born of a witch and a human, lives the life of an ordinary citizen while hiding his true identity as a witch. Meanwhile, Prince Kaian, who suffers terrible agony every new moon night due to a curse passed down through the royal family, lives with the sole goal of eliminating every witch in the world. One day, three brazen cats (witches) appear before Isaac and propose a deal, asking him to fetch a tinder box. As a result, Isaac finds himself unexpectedly entangled with Kaian. Although he is constantly gripped by a sense of danger, as if his head might be severed from his neck at any moment, Isaac, a clumsy and carefree young man who is willing to do anything for the prince, the most handsome man in the kingdom, wonders if he will truly be able to find his own happiness and fulfill the prince’s wish…?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
